cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workflow, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "snakemake_RNAseq: a containerized RNA-seq Snakemake workflow"
abstract: >-
  A Snakemake workflow for RNA-seq analysis: FastQC/fastp read QC and trimming,
  HISAT2 spliced alignment with samtools filtering, featureCounts gene
  quantification, a comprehensive advanced-QC stage (Picard, Qualimap, RSeQC),
  and Salmon transcript quantification (standard + decoy-aware). Containerized
  with Docker and Apptainer.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Ji"
    family-names: "Wang"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3443-5857"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gynecoloji/snakemake_RNAseq"
url: "https://github.com/gynecoloji/snakemake_RNAseq"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - Snakemake
  - transcript quantification
  - gene expression
  - HISAT2
  - Salmon
  - bioinformatics workflow
